    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ninja Froggy</strong> is a fast-paced, semi-open-world endless runner packed with action, absurd obstacles, and a whole lot of amphibian attitude. Playing as Froggy, you\u2019ll dash, slash, and leap your way through chaotic terrain while evading death from all directions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you survive, the more intense things get: faster enemies, denser traffic, etc. Balance combat, mobility, and resource management as you traverse a dynamically shifting world filled with secrets, distractions, and dangers.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785230/extras/fbb685c6d30277f644b5fd9d861e9f9b.avif?t=1750028169\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ninja Froggy</strong> is a fast-paced, semi-open-world endless runner packed with action, absurd obstacles, and a whole lot of amphibian attitude. Playing as Froggy, you\u2019ll dash, slash, and leap your way through chaotic terrain while evading death from all directions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you survive, the more intense things get: faster enemies, denser traffic, etc. Balance combat, mobility, and resource management as you traverse a dynamically shifting world filled with secrets, distractions, and dangers.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785230/extras/fbb685c6d30277f644b5fd9d861e9f9b.avif?t=1750028169\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
